cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "MedicagoXeniumSpatialViewer: an interactive Shiny app for Xenium spatial transcriptomics"
type: software
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-11-09"
abstract: >-
  An R Shiny app for exploring 10x Genomics Xenium in situ spatial
  transcriptomics data stored as Seurat objects. Users can check cell quality,
  cluster cells (SCTransform, PCA, UMAP), map clusters and gene expression onto
  the tissue section, and export marker genes, without writing R code. Includes
  a public demo dataset, a test suite and a pinned conda environment.
authors:
